{"seq":2,"slug":"promise-allocation-routing-engine","title":"承诺分配与履约路由引擎：拆单、门店发货/BOPIS/O2O 择址机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/omnichannel-promise-fulfillment/promise-allocation-routing-engine","wordCount":2788,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺分配与履约路由引擎-拆单-门店发货-bopis-o2o-择址机制\">承诺分配与履约路由引擎：拆单、门店发货/BOPIS/O2O 择址机制</h1><p>一个跨境订单在结账页停留 300 毫秒，平台必须回答两个不同的问题：这个订单<strong>能不能在承诺的日期送到</strong>（对外承诺），以及<strong>从哪个节点发货、要不要拆成几单</strong>（履约路由）。把这两件事混在一个&quot;库存够不够&quot;的判断里，是绝大多数全渠道平台的第一个结构性错误——前者是面向客户的概率性承诺，后者是面向运营的成本优化，二者的约束、时效和失败代价完全不同。本节拆解路由引擎的输入、择址评分、拆单组合优化，以及 BOPIS/O2O 场景下的特例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺分配-履约路由\">核心概念：承诺分配 ≠ 履约路由</h2><p><strong>承诺分配（promise allocation）</strong> 决定&quot;给客户什么承诺&quot;，输出是一个带时效边界的可用量——通常叫 ATP（available to promise）。<strong>履约路由（fulfillment routing / sourcing）</strong> 决定&quot;由谁完成&quot;，输出是一组 (订单行 → 履约节点) 的指派，可能拆成多个包裹。前者的正确性靠预留（reservation）保证，后者的正确性靠幂等重算保证。</p>\n<p>一次库存变动的可用量派生关系可以写成（与本章兄弟文档 <a href=\"../real-time-aggregation-sync/inventory-change-event-cdc-stream\">库存变动事件模型与 CDC 流</a> 同一口径）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{ATP}(n, t) = Q_{on\\_hand}(n) - Q_{committed}(n) - Q_{reserved}(n) - Q_{safety}(n, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">han</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是履约节点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{safety}(n,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>为该节点保留的安全库存</strong>——门店尤其需要，因为它还要服务到店散客，不能把货全让给线上。</p>\n<p>关键术语：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>履约节点（node）</td>\n<td>能独立拣货发货的最小物理单元</td>\n<td>仓、前置仓、门店、3PL、供应商直发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sourcing rule</td>\n<td>节点候选集 + 排序规则的声明</td>\n<td>IBM Sterling OMS 的 sourcing rule、SAP aATP 的替代策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fulfillment order</td>\n<td>拆单后的&quot;待履约单元&quot;，与客户订单是一对多</td>\n<td>Shopify Admin GraphQL 的 <code>FulfillmentOrder</code> 对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>assignedLocation</td>\n<td>该履约单元被指派到的节点</td>\n<td>Shopify <code>FulfillmentOrder.assignedLocation</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬分配 / 软分配</td>\n<td>已扣减实物 / 仅预留额度带 TTL</td>\n<td>自研 OMS 的两种预留模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pick SLA</td>\n<td>门店从接单到&quot;可自提&quot;的时限</td>\n<td>BOPIS 运营指标，通常按小时计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户订单&lt;br/&gt;行项目 + 收货承诺] --&gt; B[承诺分配&lt;br/&gt;ATP 检查 + 预留 TTL]&#10;  B --&gt; C[候选节点生成&lt;br/&gt;硬约束过滤]&#10;  C --&gt; D[择址评分&lt;br/&gt;成本/时效/拆单惩罚]&#10;  D --&gt; E{单节点可满足?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[单一指派&lt;br/&gt;一个包裹]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[组合优化&lt;br/&gt;最小化包裹数]&#10;  G --&gt; H[生成多个履行单元&lt;br/&gt;各自 assignedLocation]&#10;  F --&gt; I[下发 WMS / 门店任务]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[决策日志&lt;br/&gt;可解释 + 幂等键]\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户订单&lt;br/&gt;行项目 + 收货承诺] --&gt; B[承诺分配&lt;br/&gt;ATP 检查 + 预留 TTL]\n  B --&gt; C[候选节点生成&lt;br/&gt;硬约束过滤]\n  C --&gt; D[择址评分&lt;br/&gt;成本/时效/拆单惩罚]\n  D --&gt; E{单节点可满足?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[单一指派&lt;br/&gt;一个包裹]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[组合优化&lt;br/&gt;最小化包裹数]\n  G --&gt; H[生成多个履行单元&lt;br/&gt;各自 assignedLocation]\n  F --&gt; I[下发 WMS / 门店任务]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[决策日志&lt;br/&gt;可解释 + 幂等键]</pre><p>Shopify 的公开模型印证了这套结构：当订单行被指派到不同地点时，订单会被拆成多个 fulfillment order，每个携带自己的 <code>assignedLocation</code>；平台还提供 <code>fulfillmentOrderSplit</code> mutation 做主动拆分，以及&quot;地点优先级（location priority）&quot;这一显式排序（Shopify Help Center, <em>Change the priority of locations for fulfilling orders</em>；Shopify Admin GraphQL <code>FulfillmentOrder</code> 文档）。注意 Shopify 每季度发布一个 Admin API 版本（2026-01 至 2026-10），字段语义随版本演进，集成时须锁定版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选节点生成与择址评分\">候选节点生成与择址评分</h2><p>候选节点生成是<strong>硬约束过滤</strong>，不是排序。第一步就把不可能的节点剔除，避免它们污染后续评分：节点是否上架该 SKU、是否支持该渠道（线上订单能否从门店发）、是否允许危险品/温控、是否在承诺的截止时间前能完成拣货、是否有该批次（涉及序列号映射时见 <a href=\"../unified-inventory-data-model/inventory-identity-bundle-serial-mapping\">库存标识与序列号/批次映射</a>）、门店在营业时间内与否。</p>\n<p>过滤后的软评分通常是一个加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>splitPenalty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(n) = w_1 \\hat{c}(n) + w_2 \\hat{t}(n) + w_3 \\frac{|O_n^{unfilled}|}{|O|} + w_4 \\cdot \\text{splitPenalty}(n) - w_5 \\cdot \\text{risk}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1285em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class