ass=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">splitPenalty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：归一化后的履约成本（拣货人工 + 包材 + 出向运费，门店发货通常比 DC 贵）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{t}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1285em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：承诺时效的紧度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|O_n^{unfilled}|/|O|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>：该节点能同时满足的剩余行比例——<strong>这是让分单率下降的关键项</strong></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>splitPenalty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{splitPenalty}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">splitPenalty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：若选中该节点会新增一个包裹，则加罚</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{risk}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：门店库存准确率与缺货风险的估计</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>跨境场景下的特殊性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出向运费</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n<td>跨境/海外仓按分区计费，跨区发货成本陡增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门店库存准确率</td>\n<td>越大越好</td>\n<td>门店盘点误差常年在个位数百分比，需按历史漂移打折</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拣货能力/工位</td>\n<td>有上限</td>\n<td>大促时门店单日拣货量是硬瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货处理能力</td>\n<td>加分</td>\n<td>临近客户的门店退货成本更低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税与清关地</td>\n<td>硬约束</td>\n<td>跨境必须保证发货地能产生正确原产地与申报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配送方式匹配</td>\n<td>硬约束</td>\n<td>BOPIS 只能从客户可到达的门店发货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本与时效都是<strong>估计值而非真值</strong>，所以评分必须可解释、可回放：每个决策要记录当时的输入快照，否则运营问&quot;为什么这单从 300 公里外的店发&quot;时无法回答。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拆单与组合优化\">拆单与组合优化</h2><p>当没有单一节点能覆盖全部订单行时，问题变成&quot;用最少几个节点覆盖所有行，且不超各节点容量&quot;。这是一个集合覆盖/装箱混合问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∋</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{n \\in N} y_n \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{n \\ni i} x_{i,n} = 1 \\ \\ \\forall i, \\qquad \\sum_{i} x_{i,n} \\le y_n \\cdot C_n \\ \\ \\forall n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∋</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_n \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 表示节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是否被启用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该节点的可用容量（受拣货工位与当日已排任务限制）。工程上极少直接求精确解：候选节点数几十个、行数几个到几十个，用&quot;贪心选覆盖行最多的节点 + 局部搜索交换&quot;即可接近最优，且延迟可控在毫秒级。</p>\n<p>三种拆单策略的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>目标函数</th>\n<th>何时用</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最少包裹</td>\n<td>最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之和</td>\n<td>运费敏感的跨境订单</td>\n<td>可能选成本更高的远距离节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低成本</td>\n<td>最小化总履约成本</td>\n<td>利润薄的品类</td>\n<td>包裹数上升，客户体验下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最快时效</td>\n<td>最小化最晚到达时间</td>\n<td>加急/礼品订单</td>\n<td>成本显著上升，常需从门店发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境场景多了一层：<strong>拆单会让关税与清关翻倍</strong>。同一个订单从两个国家发出，意味着两份申报、两次清关费，还可能触发目的国对&quot;同一订单多次入境&quot;的合规审查。因此跨境的路由目标函数里，拆单惩罚项的权重通常远高于国内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bopis-o2o-的择址特例\">BOPIS / O2O 的择址特例</h2><p>门店发货（ship-from-store）和线上下单到店自提（BOPIS）的择址逻辑与仓发货相反：<strong>距离优先于成本</strong>。仓发货要最小化运费，BOPIS 要最小化客户到店的不便，同时保证门店能在 Pick SLA 内备好货。</p>\n<p>BOPIS 的完整链路比&quot;指派一个门店&quot;复杂得多：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>选址</strong>：默认给客户最近且 ATP 为正的门店，但允许客户改选；跨境场景下还受&quot;该门店是否支持跨境订单&quot;限制。</li>\n<li><strong>备货</strong>：门店收到拣货任务，进入拣货波次（wave picking）。库存准确率低的门店在这里暴露——系统说有一件，货架上找不到。</li>\n<li><strong>替代（substitution）</strong>：找不到货时的降级路径是&quot;同店替代 SKU&quot;或&quot;改指派到邻近门店&quot;，后者需要一次<strong>重路由</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>超时释放</strong>：自提订单有取货窗口（常见 2–7 天）。超过窗口未取，预留必须释放、货物重新上架，且这条释放必须幂等——与 <a href=\"../unified-inventory-data-model/location-node-channel-hierarchy\">跨仓/门店/在途的统一节点层级</a> 中门店节点的可售状态联动。</li>\n<li><strong>到店交接</strong>：curbside（路边自提）需要客户的到店登记事件，把订单推进到&quot;待交接&quot;状态。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>O2O 的另一个方向是 <strong>ship-to-store</strong>（线上买、门店取，但由 DC 发货），此时路由引擎仍需选择 DC，但承诺节点是门店。它和 BOPIS 共享&quot;门店作为交付点&quot;的语义，但是两条完全不同的库存路径：BOPIS 消耗门店 ATP，ship-to-store 不消耗。</p>\n<p>门店侧最重要的工程约束是<strong>安全库存</strong>：门店必须为到店散客保留一部分货，否则线上会把门店清空、线下顾客买不到。这个比例是路由引擎的入参，通常按门店历史客流与品类动销率动态设定，而不是全局常量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-引擎形态-幂等与可观测\">工程实现：引擎形态、幂等与可观测</h2><p>路由引擎有两种主流形态。<strong>规则引擎</strong>（IBM Sterling OMS 的 sourcing rule、Oracle Retail Order Broker 的 sourcing 配置、SAP S/4HANA advanced ATP 的替代策略）把候选与排序声明成配置，可解释、可运营调参，但难以表达组合优化。<strong>优化器</strong>用求解或搜索直接输出指派，效果好但黑盒，且需要严格的决策记录才能运维。成熟平台通常是两者叠加：规则引擎做候选过滤与默认排序，优化器只在多节点场景介入。</p>\n<p>跨境的复杂度还在于<strong>路由决策必须可重算</strong>。订单在承诺后可能因为库存变动、门店关店、清关异常而需要重路由。重路由的正确性依赖两点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>幂等键</strong>：以 (订单行, 路由版本) 为键，重复触发重路由不产生重复指派。这与 CDC 侧的至少一次投递是同一类问题（microservices.io 的 transactional outbox 模式指出中继重投递不可避免）。</li>\n<li><strong>状态机约束</strong>：一旦拣货开始或包裹已交接给承运商，重路由不再合法，只能走取消或退货路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结账页的延迟预算通常要求在百毫秒级完成&quot;承诺分配&quot;，而完整路由可以<strong>异步化</strong>：先返回一个可承诺的面，稍后在履约编排里确定最终节点。这个拆分——同步给承诺、异步做路由——是全渠道平台能在高并发结账下保持可用的核心手段。</p>\n<p>决策日志至少要能回答&quot;为什么是它&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>候选节点集与过滤原因</td>\n<td>复盘为何某仓没被选中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各信号的取值与权重</td>\n<td>调参与纠纷举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被选中的目标函数值</td>\n<td>与其他候选的差距</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎版本与规则版本</td>\n<td>归因行为漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入快照（ATP、时间戳）</td>\n<td>重放该次决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>承诺分配与履约路由是两条独立的流水线：前者用预留和 ATP 保证&quot;说得出就做得到&quot;，后者用节点过滤 + 加权评分 + 拆单组合优化决定&quot;由谁来做&quot;。择址的核心是把硬约束（渠道资格、合规、清关地）与软信号（成本、距离、拆单惩罚、库存准确率）分层处理，跨境订单必须给拆单惩罚极高权重，因为拆单意味着双份清关。BOPIS/O2O 把&quot;距离优先&quot;和&quot;门店安全库存&quot;引入目标函数，并额外承担拣货 SLA、替代与超时释放的幂等责任。工程上让同步的承诺分配与异步的履约路由分离、让每次决策可解释可重放，是这套引擎能在大促与跨境复杂约束下持续运行的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺分配与履约路由引擎：拆单、门店发货/BOPIS/O2O 择址机制","id":"承诺分配与履约路由引擎-拆单-门店发货-bopis-o2o-择址机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺分配 ≠ 履约路由","id":"核心概念-承诺分配-履约路由"},{"level":2,"text":"候选节点生成与择址评分","id":"候选节点生成与择址评分"},{"level":2,"text":"拆单与组合优化","id":"拆单与组合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"BOPIS / O2O 的择址特例","id":"bopis-o2o-的择址特例"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：引擎形态、幂等与可观测","id":"工程实现-引擎形态-幂等与可观测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ATP 可承诺量与安全缓冲模型：承诺口径、缓冲策略与渠道配额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/omnichannel-promise-fulfillment/atp-promise-safety-buffer-model"},"next":{"title":"超卖与履约 SLA 违约处置：超卖拦截、承诺违约补偿与消费者合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/omnichannel-promise-fulfillment/oversell-sla-breach-compensation"}}